For trading, I use these max position sizes to manage risk:
FX (Curreny) : Max Size 12%
Fixed Income : Max Size 10%
Equities Long Only : Normal 4% - Max 6% - Min 2%
Commodities Max : Size 4%
Options : Max Size 2%

Note: I personally classify Gold and Silver as Currency, and BTC as Commodity.

For long-only investing, I follow the Lifecycle Investing approach (great paper from Yale — I highly recommend reading it if you're under 40 years old).
